<title>USA: Mexico buys 18,000 T U.S. HRW wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Mexico buys 18,000 T U.S. HRW wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico overnight bought 18,000 tonnes U.S. hard red winter wheat slated for October delivery, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>Half of the shipment was for $190 a tonne and the other half was for $198.00 a tonne via rail.</p>
<p>&quot;It is going to two bridge crossings at the Rio Grande,&quot; one exporter said.</p>
<p>Another exporter noted El Paso and Nogales as the shipping points.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
